{"sections":[{"slug":"中心","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"中心"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中心</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"中心"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">群</span></h3>\n<p>$\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的群</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或幺半群</span>) $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">中心</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">中与所有元素交换的元素构成的子集</span>:\n$$\r\nZ(G) = \\{g\\in G | \\forall h\\in G, gh=hg\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对更一般的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>) $G$,\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nZ(G) := \\operatorname{Aut}_{\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(\\mathbf{B}G)}(\\mathrm{id}).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$Z(G) = \\Omega^2(\\mathsf{Ani}^\\simeq,\\mathbf{B}G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathsf{Ani}^\\simeq$ (“"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的生象</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathbf{B}G$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的二重</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">可见</span> $Z(G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E2-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_2$"}},{"Plain":"-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>);</li>\n<li>$\\mathbf{B}Z(G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(\\mathbf{B}G)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathrm{id}_{\\mathbf{B}G}$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的连通分支</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个生象</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的连通分支是</span> $A\\to\\tau_{\\leq 0} A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的纤维</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">此外</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">两个群的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">不带点</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的映射空间满足</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(\\mathbf{B}G,\\mathbf{B}H)\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Grp}(\\mathsf{Ani})}(G,H)/_{\\mathrm{Ad}} H,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">即群同态的生象关于</span> $H$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/共轭作用","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">共轭作用</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的商</span>,\n<span lang=\"zh\">因此该定义也可等价地陈述如下</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群的外自同构","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">外自同构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\operatorname{Out}(G)&amp;=\r\n\\tau_{\\leq 0}\r\n(\\operatorname{Aut}_{\\mathsf{Grp}}(G) /_{\\mathrm{Ad}} G)\\\\\r\n&amp; =\\tau_{\\leq 0}\\operatorname{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群短正合列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">短正合列</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathbf{B}Z(G) \\to \\mathsf{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G) \\to \\operatorname{Out}(G)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">以及</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维列","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维列</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    \\mathbf{B}Z(G) &amp;\\to \\mathsf{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G) \\to \\operatorname{Out}(G)\\\\\r\n\\to \\mathbf{B}^2Z(G) &amp;\\to \\mathbf{B}\\mathsf{Aut}(\\mathbf{B}G) \\to \\mathbf{B}\\operatorname{Out}(G).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">环</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定交换环</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为基环</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">中心</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是与所有元素交换的元素的集合</span>\n$$\r\nZ(A) = \\{a\\in A | \\forall b\\in A, ab=ba\\},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">也是</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $(A,A)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模的自同态的集合</span>\n$$\r\nZ(A) = \\operatorname{End}_{\\mathsf{BiMod}(A,A)}(A),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">也是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/等化子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">等化子</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nZ(A) = \\operatorname{eq}\\big(\r\n    A\\rightrightarrows \\operatorname{Hom}_k(A,A)\r\n\\big),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中两个映射分别为左乘与右乘</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">回忆</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Morita范畴","text":"Morita <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的恒等态射即是</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $(A,A)$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">因此</span>, $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的中心又可理解为</span>\n$$\r\nZ(A) = \\operatorname{End}_{\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathsf{Morita}}(A)}(\\mathrm{id}).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">进一步</span>, Morita <span lang=\"zh\">范畴嵌入线性范畴的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的中心也可定义为</span>\n$$\r\nZ(R) := \\operatorname{End}_{\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathsf{Cat}}(\\mathsf{Mod}(A))}(\\mathrm{id}).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong>Drinfeld <span lang=\"zh\">中心</span></strong> $Z(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/辫幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">辫幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">可理解为两个函子</span> $\\mathcal C \\to \\operatorname{Hom}_k(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/等化子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">等化子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其对象为</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">配备自然变换</span>\n$$\r\nX\\otimes (-) \\to (-)\\otimes X,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">满足两个自然变换</span> $X\\otimes (Y\\otimes Z)\\to (Y\\otimes Z)\\otimes X$ <span lang=\"zh\">相等</span>.</p>\n<h3>2-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的对象</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">中心</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半群</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nZ(X) := \\operatorname{End}_{\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(X)}(\\mathrm{id}_X).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">它类似于</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">处的二阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":".\n<span lang=\"zh\">由</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Eckmann--Hilton论证","text":"Eckmann–Hilton <span lang=\"zh\">论证</span>"}},{"Plain":", $Z(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E2-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_2$"}},{"Plain":" <span lang=\"zh\">幺半群</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">辫幺半群</span>).</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这样定义的中心又称</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hochschild上同调","text":"Hochschild <span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/余中心","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">余中心</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}